message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "dots-vue-demo-settings"
abstract: >
  Reference configuration repository for the dots-vue front-end, used by the DoTS
  demonstration site. It gathers the per-collection settings files that drive the
  appearance, routing, custom pages, search behaviour and facet selection of a
  dots-vue instance, and serves as a worked example for projects building their own
  settings repository.
